{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/04/7169196/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会終わりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/04/7169196/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/04/7169196/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予告していた\nチャイナ系というのは\nこんな感じの\nシースルーチャイナワンピース\n(中はいずこねこT)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さん手作りデス\nデザイン案だしたら\n作れちゃう母なのでありがたいo(｡･‧̫･｡)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと\nチャイナボタン風髪飾り\nは握手会の待ち時間でつくってみた。\n陽菜の手作りデス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/04/7169196/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとなく\n想像でチャイナっぽい髪飾りを( .. )\nどうかな？結構上手にできた♥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女のこにどうやって作るのー？\nって言われたけど\n赤い紐1mあれば作れちゃう！98円でできた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中央を固結びして\nお花イメージで\nそこに向かって輪っかを\n１個づつ縫っていく感じ！\n(最初は小さくでどんどん大きい輪っかつくる。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"形できたら余った紐は\nバランスみて残したい長さのとこで\n固結びして切る！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに\n「君の名は。」の\nみつはちゃんぽい髪～っていわれた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/04/7169196/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(多分赤い紐だったから笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた人有難う！！\n楽しかったな～～謝謝\nまたよかったら愛に来てね～(^｡^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/04/7169196/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ最近は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宗教法人マラヤの曲きくのにはまってる。\n本当に頭にのこる中毒性すごい、、\n「仏像殺人事件」って曲特にすき。\npvも可愛いし声も可愛い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りかちゃんも鎌田ちゃんもかわいいし\n壺かいたい(前にイベントで1壺8万で売ってた)\nって思うくらいにはまってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/04/7169196/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/04/7169196/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(そんなお金ないけど気持ちはそのくらい好き)(元々りかちゃんファン)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後が好きそうな個性派な\nバンドとかアイドル教えてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/04/7169196/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/04/7169196/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/04/7169196/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/04/7169196/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10/1 Popteen発売中\n(まあやとハロウィン企画)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10/8 UTB＋\n(七瀬の連載ページ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10/10 MARQUEE\n(わたしの連載ページ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェックよろしくお願いします\n詳細はまたブログに書きますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち"}],"source":"archive"}